 "title": "MMSZ4xxxT1G and SZMMSZ4xxxT1G series: 500 mW Zener voltage regulators, 1.8 V to 43 V, SOD-123",
 "source": {
  "revision": "Rev. 11, March 2017",
  "pages": 6
 },
 "summary": "A family of single silicon Zener diodes in the two-lead SOD-123 surface-mount package, rated 500 mW on an FR-4 or FR-5 board, with nominal Zener voltages from 1.8 V to 43 V, all specified at a 50 µA test current. SZ-prefix versions are AEC-Q101 qualified and PPAP capable. MMSZ4690T1G is the 5.6 V type: 5.32 V to 5.88 V at 50 µA, at most 10 µA of leakage at 4 V reverse, marking CV; MMSZ4690T3G is the same part on a 10,000-piece reel.",
