   "page": 1,
   "text": "The 500 mW rating holds on an FR-4 or an FR-5 board. On the FR-5 test board it applies up to a lead temperature of 75 °C and falls by 6.7 mW for each degree above that. The derating curve gives power against both lead and ambient temperature."
