  {
   "topic": "Test conditions",
   "page": 3,
   "text": "Every type is specified at a 50 µA Zener test current. The leakage figure is taken at a reverse voltage VR that rises with the type, from 1 V on the lowest-voltage parts to 32.6 V on the 43 V part. Forward voltage is at most 0.9 V at 10 mA for all types."
